{"id":"n28026-1-23","stage":0,"title":"여행 · 旅行","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28026-1-23-1","ko":"여름휴가 때 여행 간다면서?","zh":"听说你夏天休假时要去旅行？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여름휴가","meaning":"夏季休假","explanation":"여름휴가：夏季休假；上班或上学的人在夏季的假期，不专指学校暑假。","readings":[{"term":"여름휴가","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22667","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름휴가","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"여행","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}},{"text":"간다면서?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간다면서","audio":"/audio/697bef08b13e91212e3e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f326418aa384e84","term":"여름휴가","zh":"夏季休假","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3","entryId":"22667","definition":"上学或上班的人在夏季的一段休假。","pronunciation":["여름휴가"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d1228bab82c473544c0c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28026-1-23-2","ko":"응. 어디로 갈지 아직 고민 중이야.","zh":"嗯，还在考虑去哪里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"嗯","explanation":"응：非敬语的肯定应答。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디로","audio":"/audio/0fbbfd5af1ab3c98e173.mp3"}},{"text":"갈지","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈지","audio":"/audio/07400561f16d599d0f7d.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"고민","meaning":"考虑、拿不定主意","explanation":"고민：反复考虑、拿不定主意；这里是在考虑旅行去哪里。","readings":[{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19225","senseId":"1","lemma":"고민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}},{"text":"중이야.","meaning":"正在……中","explanation":"중：处于某个动作或状态之中；고민 중이야 即“正在考虑”。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이야","audio":"/audio/1aa751351350901e0cb7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"嗯、是啊","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"嗯、是啊","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"2d27a95090cbb680","term":"고민","zh":"考虑、拿不定主意","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3","entryId":"19225","definition":"为做决定而反复思量；这里指还没想好旅行目的地。","pronunciation":["고민"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"正在……中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"表示某个动作或状态正在进行的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]}],"audio":"/audio/221b55c9ef46d58267b0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28026","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":17,"sequenceScore":0.6122,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，还在考虑去哪里。","听说你夏天休假时要去旅行？","请帮我打一把刀。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说你夏天休假时要去旅行？","请帮我打一把刀。","嗯，还在考虑去哪里。"],"answer":2}]}
